  "description": "DapperX is a compile-time, source-generator-powered data access framework for .NET built on top of Dapper. Define entities and repository interfaces with attributes and get reflection-free, fully-typed repository implementations at build time — including CRUD, batch/graph operations, paging & sorting, soft delete, multi-tenancy, auditing, lifecycle hooks, and a compact query language (CPQL) — for SQL Server, PostgreSQL, MySQL, and SQLite.",
